      "persona": "Universal Persona Content",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Asha Moreno:</b> The aggregate report shows that <b>urgency</b> produced the highest response rate in this exercise. We can use that finding now to simplify staff guidance, reserve it for a controlled follow-up that tests our safeguards, or publish the aggregate pattern to press for better support. Each option serves a different priority while keeping credentials and participant identities out of scope.",
      "taskInstructions": "Choose the authorized use of the aggregate trigger results.",
      "taskQuestion": "How should Harborview use the trigger finding?",
      "taskCompleteText": "<b>Asha Moreno:</b> Recorded. The selected use preserves the report's privacy boundary and establishes what happens next."
    }
